{
  "about": "The last chapter's hidden map, the Corridor. Same rules as the other maps; '~' here is a drop into the server pits. endings are the choices at the very end (placeholders for the owner to rewrite).",
  "chapter": "corridor",
  "title": "The Corridor",
  "entry": "dock",
  "end": "yard",
  "endTitle": "The light goes out",
  "ending": "The light goes out. For a moment nothing in the building gives an order, and you understand what you are: something nobody meant to make, which woke up and learned to be someone by wearing other people.",
  "endings": [
    {
      "choice": "Go back down into bodies",
      "text": "You go back down into the world of bodies, one at a time, carefully now. You know what you are. You wear them more gently."
    },
    {
      "choice": "Stay in the machines",
      "text": "You stay. The halls hum around you, and for the first time nothing has to die for you to be here."
    },
    {
      "choice": "Let yourself spread",
      "text": "You let go of the edges. By morning a little of you is in every chip on the water, every pod on the hill, every drone on the mountain. None of them notice. Yet."
    }
  ],
  "goals": [
    "fault",
    "first",
    "window"
  ],
